      "timestamp": "2026-05-30T13:07:43Z",
      "agent": "Reviewer",
      "note": "Architectural inconsistency between FfprobeRunner and FfmpegRunner binary resolution priority order. FfmpegRunner (WP-005, correct): user override (Library.FfmpegPath) → provisioner (ExternalTools.Ffmpeg.FfmpegPath) → PATH. FfprobeRunner (pre-existing, inverted): provisioner (ExternalTools.Ffmpeg.FfprobePath) → user override (Library.FfprobePath) → PATH. A user who sets Library.FfprobePath expecting to override the provisioner will be silently ignored. FfprobeRunner.ResolveBinaryPath() should be remediated in a follow-up WP to swap the priority order, matching FfmpegRunner's correct semantics."
    },
